Z||000000||Homicidal||08-29-2000||08:34 PM||||I wanna replace my 84' SE's with some nice GT Fascia's like HuGRRR's Fiero.  Does anybody know the cost of the two?<P>And what about the cost to paint the parts?<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||5
